# QA M7 acceptance (regression): a second run after the marked title.
# Run 1 is flow_m7_cafe_zauner_ending_skip's (Café Zauner in the title
# flow: complete at 2441, every ending phase skipped, the marked title at
# 3239). START at 3299 (the title's 60th frame, E50) starts run 2 from the
# run's first stage with the run reset (score 0, 3 lives, Normal, HUD and
# run Oblaten 0) and the mark kept. Run 2 plays run 1's inputs from its
# START on, frame for frame 3278 frames later: the same play (complete at
# 5719 with the same score 24200 and 13 Oblaten, so nothing of run 1 leaks
# into run 2), the same ending, and the marked title again at 6517, ending
# on it untouched (6547). The replay format checks the first completion
# only; the end state proves run 2 reached the ending and the title again.
